format: clearglass.gig/1
platform: fiverr
title: I will build a custom MCP server so Claude can use your tools and data
category: Programming & Tech
subcategory: AI Development
tags:
  - mcp server
  - claude code
  - mcp
  - ai agent tools
  - claude integration
description: >-
  Want Claude (or another AI) to work with your own tools, files or database instead of copy and
  paste? I build an MCP server for it: a set of tools the AI can call, safely, with only the access
  you allow.


  What you get:

  - An MCP server with the tools you need (search, read, query, create, update)

  - Each tool limited to what you allow, with clear errors instead of silent failures

  - Setup for Claude Code or Claude Desktop, tested with real calls

  - A short guide to adding more tools later


  I run my own MCP server every day: my AI coder uses it to search, read and check a large
  project. Yours gets the same care.
